flowchart LR
    A[NFL play-by-play data] --> B[Game-level table]
    B --> C[Team game history table]

    C --> D[Rolling offensive features<br/>EPA, success rate, explosive rate, pass/rush EPA]
    C --> E[Rolling defensive features<br/>EPA allowed, success allowed, takeaways, sack rate]
    C --> F[Point differential / net EPA]

    D --> G[Pregame team feature snapshot]
    E --> G
    F --> G

    B --> H[Elo rating history]
    H --> I[Pregame Elo features]

    G --> J[Historical matchup rows]
    I --> J

    J --> K[Train calibrated classifier]
    K --> L[Matchup win probability]
    L --> M[prediction.json]

    K --> N[Accuracy / ROC AUC / log loss / Brier score]
    N --> O[metrics.json]